\cf1\b You\'92re all set!\b0\cf0\par
\par
Launch \b ULTIMATE-FILE-CONVERTER\b0  from the Start Menu or desktop shortcut. On first run, the app will offer to install the required conversion tools (FFmpeg, ImageMagick, MuPDF, Pandoc, LibreOffice, 7-Zip, Calibre, FontForge) using \b winget\b0 . Windows may prompt for permission per package.\par
\par
\b Quick start\b0\par
\par
\bullet  Drag files into the window, or click \b Add files\b0  (\b Ctrl+O\b0 ).\par
\bullet  Pick a target format from the Convert-to menu.\par
\bullet  Click \b Convert\b0  (\b Ctrl+R\b0 ) to run the batch.\par
\bullet  Output files land next to the original by default. Change the output folder in Settings.\par
\par
\b Supported formats (40+)\b0\par
\par
\bullet  \b Images\b0  \emdash  JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, AVIF, GIF, BMP, TIFF, SVG, ICO, RAW (CR2, NEF, ARW, DNG)\par
\bullet  \b Audio\b0  \emdash  MP3, WAV, FLAC, AAC, M4A, OGG, Opus, AIFF\par
\bullet  \b Video\b0  \emdash  MP4, MOV, MKV, WebM, AVI\par
\bullet  \b Documents\b0  \emdash  PDF, DOCX, DOC, ODT, RTF, HTML, Markdown, EPUB, AZW3, MOBI, LaTeX, TXT\par
\bullet  \b Spreadsheets\b0  \emdash  XLSX, ODS, CSV\par
\bullet  \b Presentations\b0  \emdash  PPTX, ODP\par
\bullet  \b Subtitles\b0  \emdash  SRT, ASS/SSA, WebVTT, SBV\par
\bullet  \b Archives\b0  \emdash  ZIP, 7-Zip, TAR, TAR.GZ\par
\bullet  \b Fonts\b0  \emdash  TTF, OTF, WOFF, WOFF2\par
\par
\b Removing\b0\par
\par
Use Windows Settings \f1\fs18 >\f0\fs20  Apps to uninstall. The app does not modify system files or shared folders. Conversion tool packages installed by winget are managed separately in winget.\par
\par
\f0\fs18\i No accounts, no network calls during conversion, no usage tracking. Every file you convert stays on this PC.\i0\par
